{"catalogue_version":"2026.09.16","hits":[{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#hip","id":"hiecm.glossary.hip","summary":"The role held by a system that holds a patient's records and shares them when a consent allows it.","title":"HIP, health information provider","type":"glossary"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/10-m2-post-health-information-transfer#m2-on-data-notification","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-data-notification","summary":"The HIP posts the encrypted records straight to the HIU's data push URL, outside the gateway.","title":"The provider pushes encrypted health information to the URL named in the request","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"","id":"hiecm.glossary.m2","summary":"The milestone covering care context linking, discovery and sending records.","title":"M2 Health Information Provider: Create and link records","type":"glossary"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/errors#abdm-1035","id":"hiecm.error.abdm-1035","summary":"ABDM does not recognise the health information provider id on the call, which is a registration problem rather than a request problem.","title":"ABDM-1035, the HIP id is not recognised","type":"error"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#hie-cm","id":"shared.glossary.hie-cm","summary":"The ABDM building block that holds ABHA addresses, the links to each address's records, and the consent that authorises sharing them. It is not the gateway.","title":"HIE-CM, Health Information Exchange and Consent Manager","type":"glossary"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#ims","id":"hiecm.glossary.ims","summary":"The umbrella term for the software a health facility runs, whichever of HMIS, EMR, LIMS or PMS it happens to be.","title":"IMS, information management system","type":"glossary"},{"doc_url":"","id":"shared.decision.role-model-two-axes","summary":"HIP, HIU, HRP and the health locker read as one list of four roles. This catalogue separates the entity that holds the role from 